/-! Checked exclusions of the 117 saved root-filter and positive-perturbation
polynomials. This is a finite table, not a complete classification of factors
in any degree range and not a proof of the original conjecture. -/
set_option maxHeartbeats 2000000
set_option maxRecDepth 100000
namespace Erdos406JointPrefixData
open Polynomial Erdos406JointPrefix Erdos406Quotient Erdos406ReciprocalFlip

structure Case where
